                                                "sense_id": "9427a5fa-2ff2-3154-9944-e90b3b66248e",
                                                "text": "At first glance, Lincoln seemed caught in a time warp—a place of 1930s tourist cabins and Mom-and-Pop diners where one could get honest-to-goodness milk shakes, made in a blender with real ice cream."
